Template: libkrun/add_user_to_group
Type: note
Description: libkrun Configuration
 To use libkrun as a normal user, add your user to the `kvm' group with the following command:
 .
 sudo usermod -aG kvm $(whoami)
 .
 After adding your user to the group, please re-login for the changes to take effect.
Description-zh_CN.UTF-8: libkrun 配置贴士
 在普通用户下正常使用 libkrun，请使用如下命令将您的用户添加到 `kvm' 用户组：
 .
 sudo usermod -aG kvm $(whoami)
 .
 完成后，请重新登录以使更改生效。
